         NodeComment="Get the WallRunComponent via the Interface, then call its StartWallJump function if successful. The function will only perform a wall jump if it is appropriate to do so. If a jump is performed, the output pin is not used, preventing any further action from being taken. The output pin is only used if a wall jump is not performed, allowing the player\'s standard jump functions to be processed instead."
